# Tracked in git:  README.md, training/tb_amp_dataset.csv, training/general_amp_dataset.csv
# Not tracked:     sources/, release archives
#
# Reproducing the models requires training/ alone, so the two training files are
# versioned here. The upstream exports in sources/ are not: they are third-party
# database content (APD3/ADAM, DBAASP, UniProtKB) whose bulk-redistribution terms
# are summarised in the README's licensing section. Obtain them from the documented
# queries, or from the release archive.

# Third-party source exports
sources/

# Release archives (rebuildable: zip -r data_release.zip data_release)
*.zip

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
.ipynb_checkpoints/
